; Shelves (#1202): the whole stage sits 40 px higher so a catch ledge can be on screen (the 1600x900 view ends at y=450) and still keep the 128 px headroom rule. ChasmShelf (top y=420) is 136 px under the crumbling ledges and 160 px under the banks, ends 70 px short of each bank so a fall beside it still rings out. End ledges (x=720..800, top y=332, 72 px under the banks) catch a fighter who walks off an outer end. Kill zone back at y=480. Spawns are 100+ px from the spikes and 80 from the outer ends.
